{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "LFDJYXX4T2LEEPB4FHP4KLXZX3RU2TS5",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041133004",
    "title": "第4章 ジェネシスの夜明け",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 4: Genesis; Origin",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ナレーション",
            "enName": "Narrator",
            "jpText": "『有馬記念』でのテイエムオペラオーには、勝機がなかった。\n光など差さないバ群に囲まれてしまった彼女は、しかし――",
            "enText": "<i>In the Arima Kinen, T.M. Opera O had no chance \nof winning. Trapped in a pack so tight she was lost \nin its shadows. Nonetheless…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 251,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 329,
                    "pathId": -7041925909046891145
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -2844069759539557083
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6651367254606089143,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナレーション",
            "enName": "Narrator",
            "jpText": "あの走りをした。バ群を縫い、前代未聞の勝利を掴んだ。\n彼女はのちに語る――『前例がないなら、ボクが作ればいい』と。",
            "enText": "<i>…she made her presence known. Weaving through the pack, \nshe seized an unprecedented victory. Her words afterwards \nwere: \"Where there is no precedent, I only have to set one.\"</i>",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 345,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 241,
                    "pathId": 5532617403584098503
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6172625649708933537,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナレーション",
            "enName": "Narrator",
            "jpText": "インタビューにて、グラスワンダーは我々に語ってくれた。\n『有馬は、手繰り寄せました。気持ちで』――それが、あの結果だ。",
            "enText": "<i>In an interview, Grass Wonder told us: \"I pulled the Arima victory \ntowards me. With sheer willpower.\" We all saw the result.</i>",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 286,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -3180330716339215246
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 351,
                    "pathId": -3723657141363551035
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1768138910171753892,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナレーション",
            "enName": "Narrator",
            "jpText": "彼女は辛勝だった。しかし、有馬に勝った先人たちが築いた伝説を\n手本にせず――自身の最良を求めた結果が、その頂だったのだ。",
            "enText": "<i>It was a narrow victory for her. However, instead of following \nin the footsteps of previous Arima winners, she sought her own \nideal path, and reached a new peak.</i>",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 354,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 262,
                    "pathId": -2872355669046585327
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3800969606539847484
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4381835710725988288,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナレーション",
            "enName": "Narrator",
            "jpText": "スピードシンボリ。史上初のグランプリ3連覇を成し遂げたウマ娘。\nそんな彼女は、ラストランをこう語る――『根性さ、最後は』",
            "enText": "<i>Speed Symboli. The first horsegirl in history to achieve three \nconsecutive Grand Prix victories. She spoke of her final race \nlike this: \"In the end, it comes down to guts!\"</i>",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 325,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 6479477444874789317
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -4119398330757634744
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5727666089504774798
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7536869274670511236,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナレーション",
            "enName": "Narrator",
            "jpText": "2着とクビ差での勝利。前年の有馬を踏襲するのではない。\n彼女のラストランは、自身の偉業を超えるためのものだった――",
            "enText": "<i>Her victory came by a neck over the runner-up. It wasn't about \nrepeating the previous year's Arima Kinen. Her final race was \nmeant to surpass her own great achievements ——\t</i>",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 296,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 172,
                    "pathId": 2967688088802279171
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5067212149388910211
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4371376714251393451,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……………………。",
            "enText": "………",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 72,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 131,
                    "pathId": 1253907219704739924
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": 3965111730609862709
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 1270516369559069520
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3666676092297855859,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "と、トレーナーさん……トレーナーさんっ。\nちょっと、すご――すごかったですねっ……！",
            "enText": "T-Trainer… Trainer! \nTh-That was… That was amazing…!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 241,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あ、ああ。すごかったな……！",
                    "enText": "Y-Yeah. It really was…!",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "う、うん。すごかったね……！",
                    "enText": "Y-Yeah. It really was…!",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 1139196353197661600
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 3668753484247619752
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4812046651931304780,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "いえ、本当に……私から見たら、みなさんは冷静といいますか……\n勝つべくして勝ったと。そういう印象だったのですが……。",
            "enText": "No, really… From my perspective, I always thought everyone \nwas so calm, or rather… that they won because they were \nmeant to win. That was the impression I had, but…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 390,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 211,
                    "pathId": -5242794415065734677
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6690946192865932809
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5057202649411915802,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "でも……うん、そうですね。改めて映像を観ていたら……ただただ、\n全力だった。執念や根性といった泥臭さが、根底にあって――",
            "enText": "But… yeah, that's right. Watching the footage again… \nthey were just giving it their all. There was a gritty foundation \nof sheer tenacity and guts underlying it all.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 470,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 371,
                    "pathId": -8851134078387981152
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1405515744463629432
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8386274051508050447,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "そうか……歴史を作れるのは、そういう……強豪ひしめく\n勝負の中で、それでも。“気持ち”で掴めた方、なのですね。",
            "enText": "I see… The ones who can make history are those who… \neven in a fiercely competitive race… can still seize victory \nwith their \"willpower\".",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 394,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 374,
                    "pathId": -6488538400605551025
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 151,
                    "pathId": -6134300275936110338
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5755000904356547611,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……誰一人として、いませんでした。\n過去を“なぞって”、歴史を打ち立てた人は。",
            "enText": "…There wasn't a single one. Not a single person \nwho established history by \"tracing\" the past.",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 259,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ……そうだな",
                    "enText": "Yeah… That's right.",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "うん……そうだね",
                    "enText": "Yeah… That's right.",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 278,
                    "pathId": -5634016211082905776
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 286,
                    "pathId": 7831223481765627133
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4163027916061555019,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "決して、過去から学ぶこと自体は間違っていないと思う。けれど、\n偉業を成すには。生身の自分を舞台に上げる必要があるのかも――",
            "enText": "I don't think learning from the past is inherently wrong. \nHowever, to achieve greatness… maybe you need to put \nyour own raw, authentic self on the stage ——",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "今ターフを走っているのは、君なんだから",
                    "enText": "<size=32>Because the one running on the turf right now is you</size>.",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "今ターフを走っているのは、貴方なんだから",
                    "enText": "<size=32>Because the one running on the turf right now is you</size>.",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 258,
                    "pathId": 3251950336223163390
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 229,
                    "pathId": 5388730471283793233
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 807989581095868849,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "…………私。\nクロノジェネシスを、舞台に……。",
            "enText": "……Me. Chrono Genesis… on the big stage…",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 236,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 176,
                    "pathId": 6190825621249061075
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 2460783754508537312
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1899165528921430547,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そうして訪れた、トレセン学園見学会の日。\nクロノジェネシスは――",
            "enText": "And so, Tracen Academy's Open Day was upon us. \nAs for Chrono Genesis…",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 86,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5881763784842112860
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 39571281399266709,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "はっ、はっ、はっ、はっ――",
            "enText": "<i>Hahh, hah, hahh, hah…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 84,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 144,
                    "pathId": 99055338291789555
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1625041546019049106,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（芝2200m。前日の雨の影響でバ場は稍重。\n状況的には、ナカヤマさんが勝った『宝塚記念』が近い――）",
            "enText": "(2200 m on turf. The track condition is <i>yielding</i> due to \nyesterday's rain. Conditions overall are close to the \nTakarazuka Kinen that Nakayama won.)",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 288,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 361,
                    "pathId": 5373771554046214355
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8010492680625497169
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5864588016854119443,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（中団の外……ナカヤマさんが取っていた位置。\nでも、オルフェさんの時にはもう少し……）",
            "enText": "(Outside of the middle of the pack… the position Nakayama took. \nBut, when Orfevre ran, she was a little more…)",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 224,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 361,
                    "pathId": -8799027589717169258
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 188,
                    "pathId": 6976384740152620357
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4408652012264043985,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……っ！　また、考えてる……。",
            "enText": "<i>…Ghk!</i> I'm overthinking again…",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 96,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": 8413482705404328314
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -9165786842134239758
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2323833334289840275,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（私に、上がり34.7の爆発力が出せる？\n出せないなら、過去をなぞるべきじゃない）",
            "enText": "(Can I produce the explosive power needed for a 34.7 seconds \nfinal sectional? If I can't, I shouldn't try to imitate the past.)",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 216,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 361,
                    "pathId": 8997214324564449167
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -3880797945708861359
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2043945612560919846,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "だって、今日走ってるのは――",
            "enText": "Because the one running today is…",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 111,
                    "pathId": -7337653278969267484
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4017777764257662726,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……見たかった走りになりつつあると、そう思った。\n何故なら、模擬レースの際。自分が目を惹かれたのは……。",
            "enText": "…Her running was becoming exactly what I wanted to see. \nBecause what caught my eye during the practice race was…",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いけー！クロノジェネシスー！！",
                    "enText": "Go! Chrono Genesis!!",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 11,
                    "pathId": 2018208327936196725
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -505381360180274396,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（……トレーナーさんの声が聞こえる。\n応援してくれている。――他でもない、私を）",
            "enText": "(…I can hear Trainer's voice, cheering for me. \nMe, and no one else.)",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 273,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 355,
                    "pathId": -3348001248843956581
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4057645013510475790,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（そうだ。今日ここで走っているのは――\n歴史を紡いできた、彼女たちじゃない）",
            "enText": "(That's right. The one running here today is… not any of \nthe girls who wove together the fabric of history.)",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 195,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 355,
                    "pathId": -6504974163598240808
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9117370034895446054,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "まだ何者でもない、私だ。",
            "enText": "It's me, who is still a nobody.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 104,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 355,
                    "pathId": -9011678306206599615
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -1714006601833230565
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5616587345959739021,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（なら、歴史は“おおよそ”参考にすればいい。\nイメージさえ掴めたら、その先は――！）",
            "enText": "(In that case, I just need to use history as a rough guide. \nAs long as I have a mental image, the rest is up to me!)",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 241,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 355,
                    "pathId": 3628538200693375370
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2959151223223695031,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "実況",
            "enName": "Commentator",
            "jpText": "おーっと！　残り200m、クロノジェネシスが追い込みをかけた！\n素晴らしい末脚！　届くか！　届くか！？",
            "enText": "Whoaaa! With 200 m left, Chrono Genesis makes her final push! What a magnificent closing sprint! Will she reach the lead?! \nWill she make it?!",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 238,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 262,
                    "pathId": -9069387656872589393
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3464118104855555842,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（私はこれまで、歴史の背中を追いかけてきた。\n追いつきたくて……そこに、私もいたくて）",
            "enText": "(Up until now, I've been chasing after history. \nI wanted to catch up… I wanted to be there, too.)",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 261,
            "voiceIdx": 24,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 336,
                    "pathId": -2374648291862464697
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -6566439352117888040
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 390,
                    "pathId": -1177208160530946775
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1247426687145334671,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（でも、違う。それじゃあ歴史の当事者にはなれない。\n私として、蹄跡を刻みたいのなら――）",
            "enText": "(But that's wrong. I can't become a part of history that way. \nIf I want to leave my own footprints…)",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 304,
            "voiceIdx": 25,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 506,
                    "pathId": 2747058726650158913
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 489,
                    "pathId": 6521706905738940236
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3549175674542478139,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "勝たなきゃ……勝ちたい。勝ちたいっ！\n歴史を作ったウマ娘に！　偉業を残した先人に！！",
            "enText": "I have to win… I want to win. <i>I want to win!</i>\nAgainst the horsegirls who crafted history! \nAgainst my celebrated predecessors!!",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 303,
            "voiceIdx": 26,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 355,
                    "pathId": 7746067613604839872
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -6629214556220584918
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2985587171763657042
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3946241886404019078,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
